,"start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8cae5db6-db0e-11ef-afcf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"8cae5db7-db0e-11ef-bc55-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":162,"tongjian_id":"8cae5dbb-db0e-11ef-851d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交","人事"],"content":"3趙王得楚和氏璧，秦昭王欲之，請易以十五城。趙王欲勿與，畏秦強；欲與之，恐見欺。以問藺相如，對曰：「秦以城求璧而王不許，曲在我矣。我與之璧而秦不與我城，則曲在秦。均之二策，寧許以負秦。臣願奉璧而往；使秦城不入，臣請完璧而歸之！」趙王遣之。相如至秦，秦王無意償趙城。相如乃以詐紿秦王，復取璧，遣從者懷之，間行歸趙，而以身待命於秦。秦王以爲賢而弗誅，禮而歸之。趙王以相如爲上大夫。","content_fanyi":"赵惠文王得到楚国的和氏璧，秦昭襄王想要得到它，提出用十五座城邑向赵国交换。赵惠文王不想交出和氏璧，又畏惧秦国强大；想交出它，又担心被欺骗。赵惠文王就此事询问蔺相如，蔺相如回答说：“秦国用城邑来求取和氏璧，大王若不答应，理亏的是我们赵国。如果我们把和氏璧给了秦国，秦国却不把城邑给我们，理亏的便是秦国。权衡这两种对策，宁可答应交换，让秦国背负理亏。臣愿意捧着和氏璧前往；如果秦国不把城邑交给我们，臣一定完好无损地把和氏璧带回赵国！”赵惠文王于是派蔺相如持璧前往秦国。蔺相如到达秦国后，秦昭襄王并没有向赵国交付城邑的意思。蔺相如于是用计欺骗秦昭襄王，重新取回和氏璧，派随从怀揣和氏璧，从小路返回赵国，自己留在秦国听候处置。秦昭襄王认为蔺相如贤能，没有杀他，以礼相待并送他回赵国。赵惠文王任命蔺相如为上大夫。","content_jianti_auto":"3赵王得楚和氏璧，秦昭王欲之，请易以十五城。赵王欲勿与，畏秦强；欲与之，恐见欺。以问蔺相如，对曰：「秦以城求璧而王不许，曲在我矣。我与之璧而秦不与我城，则曲在秦。均之二策，宁许以负秦。臣愿奉璧而往；使秦城不入，臣请完璧而归之！」赵王遣之。相如至秦，秦王无意偿赵城。相如乃以诈绐秦王，复取璧，遣从者怀之，间行归赵，而以身待命于秦。秦王以为贤而弗诛，礼而归之。赵王以相如为上大夫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":349,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8cae5d8f-db0e-11ef-9c9b-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000371"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8cafa99f-db0e-11ef-9121-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8cafa9a0-db0e-11ef-b329-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8cafa9a1-db0e-11ef-82db-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8cafa9a2-db0e-11ef-9f30-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"嗣，祥吏翻。好，呼到翻。令，力正翻。古者縣大夫，至春秋時有邑大夫。縣令，起於戰國之時，秦、漢因之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"嗣，祥吏翻。好，呼到翻。令，力正翻。古者县大夫，至春秋时有邑大夫。县令，起于战国之时，秦、汉因之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8cafa99e-db0e-11ef-aad2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8cafa9a4-db0e-11ef-a3eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此蓋賂掌關市之官。周禮：司關掌國貨之節，以聯門市，司貨賄之出入者，掌其治禁與其征廛；司市掌市之治敎政刑，量度禁令。戰國之時，合爲一官。量，音亮。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此盖赂掌关市之官。周礼：司关掌国货之节，以联门市，司货贿之出入者，掌其治禁与其征廛；司市掌市之治教政刑，量度禁令。战国之时，合为一官。量，音亮。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8cafa9a3-db0e-11ef-b8d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"回遣，謂還其金也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"回遣，谓还其金也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"8cafa9a6-db0e-11ef-8ad0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"泄","people_name_jianti_auto":"泄","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8cafcee5-db0e-11ef-851b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"洩駕","people_name_jianti_auto":"泄驾","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8cafcee6-db0e-11ef-97db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"洩冶","people_name_jianti_auto":"泄冶","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8cafcee7-db0e-11ef-82ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"如","people_name_jianti_auto":"如","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8cafcee8-db0e-11ef-8801-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張守節","people_name_jianti_auto":"张守节","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8cafcee9-db0e-11ef-971b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"如耳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如耳","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8cafceea-db0e-11ef-9a1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏王","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏王","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8cafceeb-db0e-11ef-9ea2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"如姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"如姬","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8cafceec-db0e-11ef-aaa5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8cafceed-db0e-11ef-b1e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄭","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8cafceee-db0e-11ef-b1a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陳","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8cafceef-db0e-11ef-a068-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef0-db0e-11ef-b64d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"衞","place_name_jianti_auto":"衞","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef1-db0e-11ef-8406-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"泄，姓也，與洩同，春秋時鄭有大夫洩駕，陳有大夫洩冶。如，亦姓也；張守節以如耳爲魏大夫姓名，非也，蓋衞大夫。是時魏王有如姬。重，音輕重之重。","note_content_jianti_auto":"泄，姓也，与泄同，春秋时郑有大夫泄驾，陈有大夫泄冶。如，亦姓也；张守节以如耳为魏大夫姓名，非也，盖衞大夫。是时魏王有如姬。重，音轻重之重。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"8cafa9a7-db0e-11ef-a80a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"薄","people_name_jianti_auto":"薄","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef3-db0e-11ef-a9a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"薄疑","people_name_jianti_auto":"薄疑","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef4-db0e-11ef-a939-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"衞","place_name_jianti_auto":"衞","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef5-db0e-11ef-8f1a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"薄，姓也；風俗通，衞賢人薄疑。敵，當也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"薄，姓也；风俗通，衞贤人薄疑。敌，当也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef2-db0e-11ef-84f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"偶，匹也，對也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"偶，匹也，对也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef7-db0e-11ef-89c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"參，三也，相參列也，間廁也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"参，三也，相参列也，间厕也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef8-db0e-11ef-be24-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"縣令","official_note":"縣令是地方行政官员，负责管理县内事务，此处指卫嗣君通过赐席来考察其廉洁，体现了嗣君好察微隐的特点。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"縣令有發褥而席弊者","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"fdffd5e8-3bac-45a6-a0f1-32814c4876c0"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"财政","official_name":"關市","official_note":"關市是负责管理关隘和市场税收的官员，此处卫嗣君通过贿赂来测试其忠诚，反映了嗣君的监察手段。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"又使人過關市，賂之以金，旣而召關市，問有客過與汝金，汝回遣之；關市大恐。","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"e96adfa8-f45c-4d76-9ed8-53e11b352a4b"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-293,"link_td_description":"卫嗣君，姬姓，子南氏，名字无法考证，亦称为卫成襄侯，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一，倒数第4任国君。","link_td_id":"Q10001223","link_td_number_id":360345,"people_name":"衞嗣君","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞嗣君","people_xingming":"卫嗣君","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8cafcef9-db0e-11ef-ac5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-252,"link_td_description":"卫怀君，姬姓，子南氏，名字无法考证，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一。他是卫嗣君儿子，前292年承袭卫嗣君担任该国君主。前252年，他前往魏国朝臣，被执杀。","link_td_id":"Q10001225","link_td_number_id":360349,"people_name":"懷君","people_name_jianti_auto":"怀君","people_xingming":"卫怀君","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8cafcefa-db0e-11ef-8d21-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-293,"link_td_description":"卫嗣君，姬姓，子南氏，名字无法考证，亦称为卫成襄侯，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一，倒数第4任国君。","link_td_id":"Q10001223","link_td_number_id":360345,"people_name":"嗣君","people_name_jianti_auto":"嗣君","people_xingming":"卫嗣君","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8cafcefb-db0e-11ef-9c76-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-293,"link_td_description":"卫嗣君，姬姓，子南氏，名字无法考证，亦称为卫成襄侯，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一，倒数第4任国君。","link_td_id":"Q10001223","link_td_number_id":360345,"people_name":"嗣君","people_name_jianti_auto":"嗣君","people_xingming":"卫嗣君","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8cafcefc-db0e-11ef-902b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"泄姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"泄姬","people_xingming":"泄姬","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"8cafcefd-db0e-11ef-aa1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"如耳，战国时期卫国官员。","link_td_id":"Q10023414","link_td_number_id":8330957,"people_name":"如耳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如耳","people_xingming":"如耳","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8cafcefe-db0e-11ef-82f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"薄疑","people_name_jianti_auto":"薄疑","people_xingming":"薄疑","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8cafceff-db0e-11ef-b487-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"如耳，战国时期卫国官员。","link_td_id":"Q10023414","link_td_number_id":8330957,"people_name":"如耳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如耳","people_xingming":"如耳","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf00-db0e-11ef-8ac2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏妃","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏妃","people_xingming":"魏妃","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf01-db0e-11ef-a2a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"泄姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"泄姬","people_xingming":"泄姬","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf02-db0e-11ef-8d06-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"4衞嗣君薨，子懷君立。嗣君好察微隱，縣令有發褥而席弊者，嗣君聞之，乃賜之席。令大驚，以君爲神。又使人過關市，賂之以金，旣而召關市，問有客過與汝金，汝回遣之；關市大恐。又愛泄姬，重如耳，而恐其因愛重以壅己也，乃貴薄疑以敵如耳，尊魏妃以偶泄姬，曰：「以是相參也。」","content_fanyi":"卫国卫嗣君去世，他的儿子继位，即卫怀君。卫嗣君在位时喜好窥伺观察别人的细微隐私。有个县令在家中掀开褥子，露出下面的破席子，卫嗣君听说后，便赐给他一条好席子。县令大为惊恐，把嗣君当作神。卫嗣君又派人暗访关市，用金钱贿赂关市主管；过后召来关市主管，责问他有客人经过时给过你金钱，命你退还给他；关市主管非常惊恐。卫嗣君宠爱泄姬，器重大臣如耳，却又担心他们倚仗受宠和受器重而蒙蔽自己，于是提拔大臣薄疑，让他与如耳相匹敌，尊崇魏妃，让她与泄姬相当，说：“用这些办法让他们互相牵制。”","content_jianti_auto":"4衞嗣君薨，子怀君立。嗣君好察微隐，县令有发褥而席弊者，嗣君闻之，乃赐之席。令大惊，以君为神。又使人过关市，赂之以金，既而召关市，问有客过与汝金，汝回遣之；关市大恐。又爱泄姬，重如耳，而恐其因爱重以壅己也，乃贵薄疑以敌如耳，尊魏妃以偶泄姬，曰：「以是相参也。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":350,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8cafa99d-db0e-11ef-9039-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-316,"link_death_year":-237,"link_td_description":"荀子，名况，战国时期赵国人，儒家学者和思想家，主张性恶论，重视礼义与后天学习，曾任齐国稷下学宫祭酒、楚国兰陵令。","link_td_id":"Q10000131","link_td_number_id":5847,"people_name":"荀子","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀子","people_xingming":"荀况","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf05-db0e-11ef-a924-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"成侯","people_xingming":"遫","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf06-db0e-11ef-98dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-293,"link_td_description":"卫嗣君，姬姓，子南氏，名字无法考证，亦称为卫成襄侯，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一，倒数第4任国君。","link_td_id":"Q10001223","link_td_number_id":360345,"people_name":"嗣君","people_name_jianti_auto":"嗣君","people_xingming":"卫嗣君","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf07-db0e-11ef-a793-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-522,"link_td_description":"子产，姬姓，国氏，名侨，字子产，又字子美，以字行，谥成，是春秋末期郑国的政治家、思想家、改革家。","link_td_id":"Q10000067","link_td_number_id":1427,"people_name":"子產","people_name_jianti_auto":"子产","people_xingming":"公孙侨","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf08-db0e-11ef-b11a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[郑国公孙侨]"},{"link_birth_year":-723,"link_death_year":-645,"link_td_description":"管仲，姬姓，管氏，名夷吾，字仲，以字行，谥敬，通称为管子、管夷吾、管敬仲，颍上（今安徽省颍上县）人，春秋时期法家代表人物。齐国的政治家，哲学家，与乐毅齐名，周穆王的后代。","link_td_id":"Q10000943","link_td_number_id":38041,"people_name":"管仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"管仲","people_xingming":"管仲","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf09-db0e-11ef-98f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"荀子論之曰：成侯、嗣君，聚斂計數之君也，未及取民也。子產，取民者也，未及爲政也。管仲，爲政者也，未及修禮也。故修禮者王，爲政者強，取民者安，聚斂者亡。","content_fanyi":"荀子评论说：卫成侯、卫嗣君，是搜刮民财、精于算计的国君，还没有做到真正赢得民众的拥护。郑国的子产，是能够赢得民心的人，还没有做到治理好政务。齐国的管仲，是能够治理好政务的人，还没有做到修明礼义。因此，修明礼义的人能称王，治理好政务的人能使国家强盛，赢得民心的人能使国家安定，搜刮民财的人只能走向灭亡。","content_jianti_auto":"荀子论之曰：成侯、嗣君，聚敛计数之君也，未及取民也。子产，取民者也，未及为政也。管仲，为政者也，未及修礼也。故修礼者王，为政者强，取民者安，聚敛者亡。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":351,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8cafcf03-db0e-11ef-a242-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"三十二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"三十二年","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8cad5f62-db0e-11ef-ad6c-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（戊寅、前二八三）","year_int":-283},"message":"success","success":true}